WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.460
- Oh my god and his head
goes through the walls!

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.560
What is happening?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.760
I got to check out the
worst rated medical games.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:07.830
I did it last year

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.240
and I want to see if
anyone's learned any lessons.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.126
You with me?

00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:11.959
(makes laser impersonations)

00:00:11.959 --> 00:00:15.810
We found our first victim,
Kids Doctor Clinic.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.700
One review, Two stars.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.390
Free. Weird icon.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:20.223
I'm clicking on it.

00:00:20.223 --> 00:00:22.867
"Let play baby kids doctor clinic game.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:25.787
"Kid Doctor Clinic is a
game that make you a doctor.

00:00:25.787 --> 00:00:28.607
"We promise to create good
app for kids every week.

00:00:28.607 --> 00:00:29.720
"Thank you so much."

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.950
I think the problem here is

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:32.660
is they're creating a new app every week.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.770
Perhaps take a month.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.123
Let it, y'know, test it a little bit.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.280
It's definitely going
to hack into my phone

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.910
and steal my credit card
information or something,

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:43.743
but let's see.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.390
I love that on the bottom there's ads

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.590
for a malpractice suits.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.640
Philadelphia Injury Attorney.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.010
What child is clicking on this?

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.190
Alright, there's a child here.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.570
I have a thermometer.

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.970
I have what looks like a tongue depressor,

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.720
a stethoscope, and a flashlight.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:00:59.910
I don't know why there's a flashlight.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:01.200
In case there's a blackout?

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.110
Thermometer says...

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:05.990
Thermometer didn't say anything.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:07.390
What is going on?

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:09.960
You click the flashlight and
you look inside its mouth

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.331
and there's a little devil in there.

00:01:12.331 --> 00:01:15.120
There's an octopus inside
this child's mouth.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.770
Oh you could wipe the baby's tears

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.170
and it makes a really
awkward sound when you do.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.450
There's no learning. There's no doing.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:24.990
There's literally just, like,
you're clicking buttons.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:27.110
And there's so many
malpractice ads on this game,

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:28.460
it's kind of frightening to me.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:30.280
Are adults playing this?

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.790
Why?

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:32.623
(laughs)

00:01:32.623 --> 00:01:34.270
Bear, come play this game with me, buddy.

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.520
It's called Little Bear
Hospital, doctor game for kids.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:37.353
Come up here.

00:01:37.353 --> 00:01:40.267
"Hey, little bear doctor, our
animal friends are sick now.

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:43.137
"Please help to treat them with
advanced medical facilities

00:01:43.137 --> 00:01:44.590
"and comfortable environment."

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:45.423
No, you don't care?

00:01:45.423 --> 00:01:48.030
Bear, It's not recognizing my
face 'cause you're licking me.

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:49.893
Ah, now I have to enter my password.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.113
It won't even load.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:57.430
It's seriously not loading.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:59.066
It is good music, though.

00:01:59.066 --> 00:02:00.540
(cheerful folk music)

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:01.943
Seems like Russian music.

00:02:06.097 --> 00:02:09.100
No, I don't want notifications
from the Crazy Hospital.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.853
Alright, we have Charlie
age, 28 years old.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.913
Oh, Charlie's a little creepy.

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:19.417
"It looks like Charlie has
had a terrible reaction

00:02:19.417 --> 00:02:20.577
"to something he ate.

00:02:20.577 --> 00:02:23.277
"His face has loads of spots as a result.

00:02:23.277 --> 00:02:25.457
"Use a spot cream to clear up those spots,

00:02:25.457 --> 00:02:27.240
"then perform a general checkup."

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.610
Well, medically, this
is a little inaccurate.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:30.770
If a patient came in

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:33.430
and was having allergic reaction
as to something they ate,

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.820
facial swelling could be an
early form of anaphylaxis.

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.140
You may need to administer an EpiPen.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:43.280
Also, do you want to put
topical steroids on the face?

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:46.710
If it's short term and under
careful eye of a doctor, maybe.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.010
I don't know. Let's see.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:50.280
Let's see how I can treat
this gentleman's face.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.092
(anguished groans)

00:02:52.092 --> 00:02:54.250
(scoffs) Okay there, buddy.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.760
See these don't look like hives.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.780
These look like infected postules.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.803
I would treat these with antibiotics.

00:03:02.703 --> 00:03:04.786
(groans)

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:07.730
(sneezes)
Oh sir, cover your mouth!

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:08.563
It's COVID!

00:03:08.563 --> 00:03:09.396
Is this a toothbrush?

00:03:09.396 --> 00:03:11.210
I'm gonna brush his teeth.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.830
Whoa, those are some bad teeths.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.450
Sir, you have plaque.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:15.283
We need to get it out.

00:03:15.283 --> 00:03:18.050
You want to brush your teeth
like you're brushing a tomato.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:18.883
Not too hard.

00:03:18.883 --> 00:03:19.870
A dentist told me that.

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:22.200
Oh cool, he has fungus on his nails,

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.200
but I'm just clipping them.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.280
Giving him a manicure.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.520
Oh, do you know what I'm doing here?

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:28.170
He has an infected hair follicles,

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:29.480
so I'm pulling those hairs.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.550
It feels like a beauty treatment

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.517
more than a hospital visit
though, I'm not gonna lie.

00:03:32.517 --> 00:03:36.510
"Use the ice cold Enswell
to heal this nasty bruise."

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:40.000
Oh man, I wish cold just
heels bruises this quickly.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.410
Unfortunately it takes some
days to clear up a bruise.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.810
A bruise is essentially
broken blood vessels

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:45.710
underneath the skin

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.730
and you can't just make
that disappear overnight.

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.080
Alright, now I get why this
game has three and a half stars.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.340
It's not terrible,

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.480
although I just don't understand

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.990
why it's making me do certain things.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:55.686
Like he came out with a rash on his face

00:03:55.686 --> 00:03:58.130
and here I am cutting his fingernails

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.187
and brushing his teeth.

00:03:59.187 --> 00:04:01.177
"Beans, beans, the musical fruit.

00:04:01.177 --> 00:04:03.113
"The more you eat, the more you toot.

00:04:04.227 --> 00:04:06.757
"I think our brave pirate
Jack needs a tummy rub

00:04:06.757 --> 00:04:10.467
"to get rid of that wind
after eating all those beans.

00:04:10.467 --> 00:04:14.867
"Rub Jack's stomach to help
him ease the wind that he has."

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.490
This is awkward.

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.259
And there's a giant hand.

00:04:21.259 --> 00:04:22.820
(flatulent emissions)

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.530
I just had to massage a
Pirate's belly as he moaned

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:28.470
and I heard squirting noises
to help him pass wind.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.180
Clearly someone's taking advantage

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:33.010
of the universal healthcare
system, wherever that was.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:33.843
Wait, what?

00:04:33.843 --> 00:04:35.067
Little Ed's Junior Gym Doctor?

00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:37.527
"Gym is the perfect place to
get the proper fitness tips

00:04:37.527 --> 00:04:41.377
