starching balls."

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:53.940
(laughs) I'm gonna play
this game for one reason.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.157
I need to know what starching balls is.

00:04:56.157 --> 00:04:59.907
(energetic electronic music)

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.900
Oh, I'm going to put him
on the stationary bike.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.050
Oh, you could actually
like make him do it.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.240
He's in the doctor's office now.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.870
These are Band-Aids?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.630
But what's wrong with his leg?

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:12.863
Sorry, Little Ed.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:14.940
I'm not a fan.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.187
