00:06:18.727 --> 00:06:20.430
"Press button to start surgery."

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:21.740
Oh, start surgery.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.063
Antiseptic ball.

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:24.887
Okay. "Good job.

00:06:24.887 --> 00:06:26.797
"Apply cotton on finger."

00:06:26.797 --> 00:06:30.197
"Great work. Now apply
sanitizer strips on wound."

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.571
I don't know what those
sanitizer wipes were,

00:06:33.571 --> 00:06:35.870
and that cuts not really on his finger.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.470
So instead of putting
the cut on his finger,

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.790
they just put it on the bed.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.000
Alright this game gets a
this game gets a (raspberry)

