00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:46.390
Wow, it's freezing my phone.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:47.223
Oh my god.

00:07:47.223 --> 00:07:50.213
Sick Baby Care- A little doctor.

00:07:50.213 --> 00:07:51.337
Little doctor.

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:53.447
"Sick baby care is a new addition

00:07:53.447 --> 00:07:55.847
