For me you go like this, tears wipe.

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:23.383
For this baby.

00:09:24.698 --> 00:09:25.877
"Yupeei! Thanks doctor.

00:09:25.877 --> 00:09:27.100
"I am fine now."

